      "explanationHtml": "<span class=\"math-inline\"><math dir=\"ltr\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>P</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>S</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>=</mo><msub><mi>p</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><msub><mi>p</mi><mn>2</mn></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">P(S)=p_1p_2</annotation></semantics></math></span>, ומכפלה של שני מספרים בין 0 ל-1 קטנה או שווה לכל אחד מהם: <span class=\"math-inline\"><math dir=\"ltr\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>p</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><msub><mi>p</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><mo>≤</mo><msub><mi>p</mi><mn>1</mn></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">p_1p_2\\le p_1</annotation></semantics></math></span> כי <span class=\"math-inline\"><math dir=\"ltr\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>p</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><mo>≤</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">p_2\\le 1</annotation></semantics></math></span>. המשפט \"גדולה או שווה\" הפוך: עם <span class=\"math-inline\"><math dir=\"ltr\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>p</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><mo>=</mo><msub><mi>p</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><mo>=</mo><mn>0.5</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">p_1=p_2=0.5</annotation></semantics></math></span> מקבלים <span class=\"math-inline\"><math dir=\"ltr\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>0.25</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">0.25</annotation></semantics></math></span>, קטן מ-0.5. הסכום <span class=\"math-inline\"><math dir=\"ltr\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>p</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><mo>+</mo><msub><mi>p</mi><mn>2</mn></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">p_1+p_2</annotation></semantics></math></span> יכול לעבור את 1. הממוצע <span class=\"math-inline\"><math dir=\"ltr\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mfrac><mrow><msub><mi>p</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><mo>+</mo><msub><mi>p</mi><mn>2</mn></msub></mrow><mn>2</mn></mfrac></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\frac{p_1+p_2}{2}</annotation></semantics></math></span> גדול מ-<span class=\"math-inline\"><math dir=\"ltr\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>p</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><msub><mi>p</mi><mn>2</mn></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">p_1p_2</annotation></semantics></math></span> כמעט תמיד: עם <span class=\"math-inline\"><math dir=\"ltr\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>0.5</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">0.5</annotation></semantics></math></span> ו-<span class=\"math-inline\"><math dir=\"ltr\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>0.5</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">0.5</annotation></semantics></math></span> הוא <span class=\"math-inline\"><math dir=\"ltr\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>0.5</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">0.5</annotation></semantics></math></span> בעוד ש-<span class=\"math-inline\"><math dir=\"ltr\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>P</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>S</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>=</mo><mn>0.25</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">P(S)=0.25</annotation></semantics></math></span>.",
