        "הוא נכשל בהסתברות <span class=\"math-inline\"><math dir=\"ltr\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>−</mo><mn>0.25</mn><mo>=</mo><mn>0.75</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">1-0.25=0.75</annotation></semantics></math></span>, ו-<span class=\"math-inline\"><math dir=\"ltr\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>C</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">C</annotation></semantics></math></span> נכשלת בהסתברות <span class=\"math-inline\"><math dir=\"ltr\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>−</mo><mn>0.8</mn><mo>=</mo><mn>0.2</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">1-0.8=0.2</annotation></semantics></math></span>",
        "שניהם נכשלים יחד בהסתברות <span class=\"math-inline\"><math dir=\"ltr\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>0.75</mn><mo>+</mo><mn>0.2</mn><mo>=</mo><mn>0.95</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">0.75+0.2=0.95</annotation></semantics></math></span>",
