       "type": "numeric",
       "answer": 0.4,
       "tol": 0.001,
       "prompt": "$P(A)=0.5$, $P(B)=0.4$ ו-$P(A\\cup B)=0.7$. מהי $P(B/A)$ ?",
       "explain": "החיתוך $0.5+0.4-0.7=0.2$. המכנה הוא מה שידוע, כלומר $P(A)=0.5$: $\\frac{0.2}{0.5}=0.4$. התשובה $0.5$ מתקבלת מחלוקה ב-$P(B)$, וזה $P(A/B)$.",
       "promptHtml": "<span class=\"math-inline\"><math dir=\"ltr\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>P</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>A</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>=</mo><mn>0.5</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">P(A)=0.5</annotation></semantics></math></span>, <span class=\"math-inline\"><math dir=\"ltr\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>P</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>B</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>=</mo><mn>0.4</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">P(B)=0.4</annotation></semantics></math></span> ו-<span class=\"math-inline\"><math dir=\"ltr\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>P</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>A</mi><mo>∪</mo><mi>B</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>=</mo><mn>0.7</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">P(A\\cup B)=0.7</annotation></semantics></math></span>. מהי <span class=\"math-inline\"><math dir=\"ltr\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>P</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>B</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">/</mi><mi>A</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">P(B/A)</annotation></semantics></math></span> ?",
       "explainHtml": "החיתוך <span class=\"math-inline\"><math dir=\"ltr\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>0.5</mn><mo>+</mo><mn>0.4</mn><mo>−</mo><mn>0.7</mn><mo>=</mo><mn>0.2</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">0.5+0.4-0.7=0.2</annotation></semantics></math></span>. המכנה הוא מה שידוע, כלומר <span class=\"math-inline\"><math dir=\"ltr\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>P</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>A</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>=</mo><mn>0.5</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">P(A)=0.5</annotation></semantics></math></span>: <span class=\"math-inline\"><math dir=\"ltr\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mfrac><mn>0.2</mn><mn>0.5</mn></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mn>0.4</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\frac{0.2}{0.5}=0.4</annotation></semantics></math></span>. התשובה <span class=\"math-inline\"><math dir=\"ltr\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>0.5</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">0.5</annotation></semantics></math></span> מתקבלת מחלוקה ב-<span class=\"math-inline\"><math dir=\"ltr\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>P</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>B</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">P(B)</annotation></semantics></math></span>, וזה <span class=\"math-inline\"><math dir=\"ltr\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>P</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>A</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">/</mi><mi>B</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">P(A/B)</annotation></semantics></math></span>."
