       "type": "numeric",
       "answer": 0.125,
       "tol": 0.003,
       "prompt": "$X\\sim U_c(0,1)$ ו-$Y\\sim U_c(0,2)$ בלתי תלויים. מהי $P\\left(\\max(X,Y)<\\frac12\\right)$ ? (אפשר שבר או עשרוני)",
       "explain": "$|\\Omega|=1\\cdot2=2$. המקסימום קטן מ-$\\frac12$ כש-$X<\\frac12$ וגם $Y<\\frac12$: מלבן $\\frac12\\times\\frac12$, שטחו $\\frac14$. לכן $P=\\frac{1/4}{2}=\\frac18$.",
       "promptHtml": "<span class=\"math-inline\"><math dir=\"ltr\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>X</mi><mo>∼</mo><msub><mi>U</mi><mi>c</mi></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mn>0</mn><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mn>1</mn><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">X\\sim U_c(0,1)</annotation></semantics></math></span> ו-<span class=\"math-inline\"><math dir=\"ltr\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>Y</mi><mo>∼</mo><msub><mi>U</mi><mi>c</mi></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mn>0</mn><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mn>2</mn><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">Y\\sim U_c(0,2)</annotation></semantics></math></span> בלתי תלויים. מהי <span class=\"math-inline\"><math dir=\"ltr\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>P</mi><mrow><mo fence=\"true\">(</mo><mi>max</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>X</mi><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mi>Y</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>&lt;</mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mn>2</mn></mfrac><mo fence=\"true\">)</mo></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">P\\left(\\max(X,Y)&lt;\\frac12\\right)</annotation></semantics></math></span> ? (אפשר שבר או עשרוני)",
       "explainHtml": "<span class=\"math-inline\"><math dir=\"ltr\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">∣</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">Ω</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">∣</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>⋅</mo><mn>2</mn><mo>=</mo><mn>2</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">|\\Omega|=1\\cdot2=2</annotation></semantics></math></span>. המקסימום קטן מ-<span class=\"math-inline\"><math dir=\"ltr\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mn>2</mn></mfrac></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\frac12</annotation></semantics></math></span> כש-<span class=\"math-inline\"><math dir=\"ltr\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>X</mi><mo>&lt;</mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mn>2</mn></mfrac></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">X&lt;\\frac12</annotation></semantics></math></span> וגם <span class=\"math-inline\"><math dir=\"ltr\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>Y</mi><mo>&lt;</mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mn>2</mn></mfrac></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">Y&lt;\\frac12</annotation></semantics></math></span>: מלבן <span class=\"math-inline\"><math dir=\"ltr\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mn>2</mn></mfrac><mo>×</mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mn>2</mn></mfrac></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\frac12\\times\\frac12</annotation></semantics></math></span>, שטחו <span class=\"math-inline\"><math dir=\"ltr\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mn>4</mn></mfrac></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\frac14</annotation></semantics></math></span>. לכן <span class=\"math-inline\"><math dir=\"ltr\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>P</mi><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mn>1</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">/</mi><mn>4</mn></mrow><mn>2</mn></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mn>8</mn></mfrac></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">P=\\frac{1/4}{2}=\\frac18</annotation></semantics></math></span>."
