       "prompt": "$X\\sim U_c(0,1)$ ו-$Y\\sim U_c(0,2)$ בלתי תלויים. מהי $P\\left(\\frac YX<1\\right)$ ? (אפשר שבר או עשרוני)",
       "explain": "$\\frac YX<1\\iff y<x$ (כי $x>0$). $|\\Omega|=1\\cdot2=2$. האזור $y<x$ בתוך המלבן $(0,1)\\times(0,2)$ הוא משולש עם ניצבים $1$ ו-$1$, ושטחו $\\frac12$. לכן $P=\\frac{1/2}{2}=\\frac14$ (ולא $\\frac12$ כמו בריבוע היחידה).",
       "promptHtml": "<span class=\"math-inline\"><math dir=\"ltr\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>X</mi><mo>∼</mo><msub><mi>U</mi><mi>c</mi></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mn>0</mn><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mn>1</mn><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">X\\sim U_c(0,1)</annotation></semantics></math></span> ו-<span class=\"math-inline\"><math dir=\"ltr\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>Y</mi><mo>∼</mo><msub><mi>U</mi><mi>c</mi></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mn>0</mn><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mn>2</mn><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">Y\\sim U_c(0,2)</annotation></semantics></math></span> בלתי תלויים. מהי <span class=\"math-inline\"><math dir=\"ltr\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>P</mi><mrow><mo fence=\"true\">(</mo><mfrac><mi>Y</mi><mi>X</mi></mfrac><mo>&lt;</mo><mn>1</mn><mo fence=\"true\">)</mo></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">P\\left(\\frac YX&lt;1\\right)</annotation></semantics></math></span> ? (אפשר שבר או עשרוני)",
       "explainHtml": "<span class=\"math-inline\"><math dir=\"ltr\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mfrac><mi>Y</mi><mi>X</mi></mfrac><mo>&lt;</mo><mn>1</mn><mtext>  </mtext><mo>⟺</mo><mtext>  </mtext><mi>y</mi><mo>&lt;</mo><mi>x</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\frac YX&lt;1\\iff y&lt;x</annotation></semantics></math></span> (כי <span class=\"math-inline\"><math dir=\"ltr\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>x</mi><mo>&gt;</mo><mn>0</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">x&gt;0</annotation></semantics></math></span>). <span class=\"math-inline\"><math dir=\"ltr\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">∣</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">Ω</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">∣</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>⋅</mo><mn>2</mn><mo>=</mo><mn>2</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">|\\Omega|=1\\cdot2=2</annotation></semantics></math></span>. האזור <span class=\"math-inline\"><math dir=\"ltr\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>y</mi><mo>&lt;</mo><mi>x</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">y&lt;x</annotation></semantics></math></span> בתוך המלבן <span class=\"math-inline\"><math dir=\"ltr\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mn>0</mn><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mn>1</mn><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>×</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mn>0</mn><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mn>2</mn><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">(0,1)\\times(0,2)</annotation></semantics></math></span> הוא משולש עם ניצבים <span class=\"math-inline\"><math dir=\"ltr\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>1</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">1</annotation></semantics></math></span> ו-<span class=\"math-inline\"><math dir=\"ltr\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>1</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">1</annotation></semantics></math></span>, ושטחו <span class=\"math-inline\"><math dir=\"ltr\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mn>2</mn></mfrac></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\frac12</annotation></semantics></math></span>. לכן <span class=\"math-inline\"><math dir=\"ltr\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>P</mi><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mn>1</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">/</mi><mn>2</mn></mrow><mn>2</mn></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mn>4</mn></mfrac></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">P=\\frac{1/2}{2}=\\frac14</annotation></semantics></math></span> (ולא <span class=\"math-inline\"><math dir=\"ltr\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mn>2</mn></mfrac></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\frac12</annotation></semantics></math></span> כמו בריבוע היחידה)."
