      "recap": "קשר ליניארי חד-משמעי נותן מתאם, לא אי-מתאם.",
      "questionHtml": "<span class=\"math-inline\"><math dir=\"ltr\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>X</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">X</annotation></semantics></math></span> הוא ביט הוגן ו-<span class=\"math-inline\"><math dir=\"ltr\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>Y</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>−</mo><mi>X</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">Y=1-X</annotation></semantics></math></span>. האם <span class=\"math-inline\"><math dir=\"ltr\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>X</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">X</annotation></semantics></math></span> ו-<span class=\"math-inline\"><math dir=\"ltr\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>Y</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">Y</annotation></semantics></math></span> בלתי מתואמים?",
      "explanationHtml": "<span class=\"math-inline\"><math dir=\"ltr\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>E</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">[</mo><mi>X</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">]</mo><mo>=</mo><mi>E</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">[</mo><mi>Y</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">]</mo><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mn>2</mn></mfrac></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">E[X]=E[Y]=\\frac12</annotation></semantics></math></span> ו-<span class=\"math-inline\"><math dir=\"ltr\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>X</mi><mi>Y</mi><mo>=</mo><mi>X</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>−</mo><mi>X</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">XY=X(1-X)=0</annotation></semantics></math></span> תמיד, ולכן <span class=\"math-inline\"><math dir=\"ltr\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>E</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">[</mo><mi>X</mi><mi>Y</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">]</mo><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">E[XY]=0</annotation></semantics></math></span> ו-<span class=\"math-inline\"><math dir=\"ltr\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">C</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">o</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">v</mi></mrow><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn><mo>−</mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mn>4</mn></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mo>−</mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mn>4</mn></mfrac><mo mathvariant=\"normal\">≠</mo><mn>0</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\mathrm{Cov}=0-\\frac14=-\\frac14\\ne0</annotation></semantics></math></span>. הם מתואמים (אפילו <span class=\"math-inline\"><math dir=\"ltr\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>ρ</mi><mo>=</mo><mo>−</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\rho=-1</annotation></semantics></math></span>), וגם תלויים: אם <span class=\"math-inline\"><math dir=\"ltr\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>X</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">X=1</annotation></semantics></math></span> אז <span class=\"math-inline\"><math dir=\"ltr\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>Y</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">Y=0</annotation></semantics></math></span> בוודאות. הסימן של <span class=\"math-inline\"><math dir=\"ltr\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">C</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">o</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">v</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\mathrm{Cov}</annotation></semantics></math></span> שלילי, לא חיובי.",
