       "tol": 0.001,
       "prompt": "$X\\sim\\mathrm{Ber}(\\frac14)$ ו-$Y\\sim\\mathrm{Ber}(\\frac12)$ בלתי תלויים, ונתונה $\\boldsymbol G=\\begin{pmatrix}X&Y\\\\1&Y\\end{pmatrix}$ עם $D=\\det\\boldsymbol G=XY-Y$ ו-$T=\\mathrm{tr}\\,\\boldsymbol G=X+Y$. מהי $\\mathrm{Cov}(D,T)$ ? (אפשר שבר או עשרוני)",
       "explain": "$D=-1$ רק במצב $(X,Y)=(0,1)$ (אז $0-1=-1$), ובשאר המצבים $D=0$. לכן $E[D]=-P(0,1)=-\\frac34\\cdot\\frac12=-\\frac38$. $E[T]=\\frac14+\\frac12=\\frac34$. $E[DT]=(-1)\\cdot1\\cdot\\frac38=-\\frac38$, כי ב-$(0,1)$ מתקיים $T=1$. $\\mathrm{Cov}=-\\frac38-(-\\frac38)(\\frac34)=-\\frac38\\cdot\\frac14=-\\frac3{32}=-0.09375$.",
       "promptHtml": "<span class=\"math-inline\"><math dir=\"ltr\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>X</mi><mo>∼</mo><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">B</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">e</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">r</mi></mrow><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mn>4</mn></mfrac><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">X\\sim\\mathrm{Ber}(\\frac14)</annotation></semantics></math></span> ו-<span class=\"math-inline\"><math dir=\"ltr\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>Y</mi><mo>∼</mo><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">B</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">e</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">r</mi></mrow><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mn>2</mn></mfrac><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">Y\\sim\\mathrm{Ber}(\\frac12)</annotation></semantics></math></span> בלתי תלויים, ונתונה <span class=\"math-inline\"><math dir=\"ltr\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"bold-italic\">G</mi><mo>=</mo><mrow><mo fence=\"true\">(</mo><mtable rowspacing=\"0.16em\" columnalign=\"center center\" columnspacing=\"1em\"><mtr><mtd><mstyle scriptlevel=\"0\" displaystyle=\"false\"><mi>X</mi></mstyle></mtd><mtd><mstyle scriptlevel=\"0\" displaystyle=\"false\"><mi>Y</mi></mstyle></mtd></mtr><mtr><mtd><mstyle scriptlevel=\"0\" displaystyle=\"false\"><mn>1</mn></mstyle></mtd><mtd><mstyle scriptlevel=\"0\" displaystyle=\"false\"><mi>Y</mi></mstyle></mtd></mtr></mtable><mo fence=\"true\">)</mo></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\boldsymbol G=\\begin{pmatrix}X&amp;Y\\\\1&amp;Y\\end{pmatrix}</annotation></semantics></math></span> עם <span class=\"math-inline\"><math dir=\"ltr\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>D</mi><mo>=</mo><mi>det</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mi mathvariant=\"bold-italic\">G</mi><mo>=</mo><mi>X</mi><mi>Y</mi><mo>−</mo><mi>Y</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">D=\\det\\boldsymbol G=XY-Y</annotation></semantics></math></span> ו-<span class=\"math-inline\"><math dir=\"ltr\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>T</mi><mo>=</mo><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">t</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">r</mi></mrow><mtext> </mtext><mi mathvariant=\"bold-italic\">G</mi><mo>=</mo><mi>X</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>Y</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">T=\\mathrm{tr}\\,\\boldsymbol G=X+Y</annotation></semantics></math></span>. מהי <span class=\"math-inline\"><math dir=\"ltr\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">C</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">o</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">v</mi></mrow><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>D</mi><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mi>T</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\mathrm{Cov}(D,T)</annotation></semantics></math></span> ? (אפשר שבר או עשרוני)",
       "explainHtml": "<span class=\"math-inline\"><math dir=\"ltr\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>D</mi><mo>=</mo><mo>−</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">D=-1</annotation></semantics></math></span> רק במצב <span class=\"math-inline\"><math dir=\"ltr\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>X</mi><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mi>Y</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>=</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mn>0</mn><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mn>1</mn><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">(X,Y)=(0,1)</annotation></semantics></math></span> (אז <span class=\"math-inline\"><math dir=\"ltr\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>0</mn><mo>−</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>=</mo><mo>−</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">0-1=-1</annotation></semantics></math></span>), ובשאר המצבים <span class=\"math-inline\"><math dir=\"ltr\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>D</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">D=0</annotation></semantics></math></span>. לכן <span class=\"math-inline\"><math dir=\"ltr\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>E</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">[</mo><mi>D</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">]</mo><mo>=</mo><mo>−</mo><mi>P</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mn>0</mn><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mn>1</mn><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>=</mo><mo>−</mo><mfrac><mn>3</mn><mn>4</mn></mfrac><mo>⋅</mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mn>2</mn></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mo>−</mo><mfrac><mn>3</mn><mn>8</mn></mfrac></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">E[D]=-P(0,1)=-\\frac34\\cdot\\frac12=-\\frac38</annotation></semantics></math></span>. <span class=\"math-inline\"><math dir=\"ltr\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>E</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">[</mo><mi>T</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">]</mo><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mn>4</mn></mfrac><mo>+</mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mn>2</mn></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mn>3</mn><mn>4</mn></mfrac></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">E[T]=\\frac14+\\frac12=\\frac34</annotation></semantics></math></span>. <span class=\"math-inline\"><math dir=\"ltr\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>E</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">[</mo><mi>D</mi><mi>T</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">]</mo><mo>=</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mo>−</mo><mn>1</mn><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>⋅</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>⋅</mo><mfrac><mn>3</mn><mn>8</mn></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mo>−</mo><mfrac><mn>3</mn><mn>8</mn></mfrac></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">E[DT]=(-1)\\cdot1\\cdot\\frac38=-\\frac38</annotation></semantics></math></span>, כי ב-<span class=\"math-inline\"><math dir=\"ltr\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mn>0</mn><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mn>1</mn><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">(0,1)</annotation></semantics></math></span> מתקיים <span class=\"math-inline\"><math dir=\"ltr\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>T</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">T=1</annotation></semantics></math></span>. <span class=\"math-inline\"><math dir=\"ltr\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">C</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">o</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">v</mi></mrow><mo>=</mo><mo>−</mo><mfrac><mn>3</mn><mn>8</mn></mfrac><mo>−</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mo>−</mo><mfrac><mn>3</mn><mn>8</mn></mfrac><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mfrac><mn>3</mn><mn>4</mn></mfrac><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>=</mo><mo>−</mo><mfrac><mn>3</mn><mn>8</mn></mfrac><mo>⋅</mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mn>4</mn></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mo>−</mo><mfrac><mn>3</mn><mn>32</mn></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mo>−</mo><mn>0.09375</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\mathrm{Cov}=-\\frac38-(-\\frac38)(\\frac34)=-\\frac38\\cdot\\frac14=-\\frac3{32}=-0.09375</annotation></semantics></math></span>."
