      "step": {
       "type": "numeric",
       "prompt": "הצפיפות היא $f(x)=c\\,(1-x^2)$ בקטע $[-1,1]$. מהו $c$? (שבר או עשרוני)",
       "answer": 0.75,
       "tol": 0.001,
       "explain": "$\\int_{-1}^{1}c(1-x^2)\\,dx=c\\left[x-\\frac{x^3}{3}\\right]_{-1}^{1}=c\\left(\\frac23+\\frac23\\right)=\\frac{4c}{3}=1$, ולכן $c=\\frac34$.",
       "promptHtml": "הצפיפות היא <span class=\"math-inline\"><math dir=\"ltr\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>f</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>x</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>=</mo><mi>c</mi><mtext> </mtext><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>−</mo><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">f(x)=c\\,(1-x^2)</annotation></semantics></math></span> בקטע <span class=\"math-inline\"><math dir=\"ltr\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo stretchy=\"false\">[</mo><mo>−</mo><mn>1</mn><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mn>1</mn><mo stretchy=\"false\">]</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">[-1,1]</annotation></semantics></math></span>. מהו <span class=\"math-inline\"><math dir=\"ltr\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>c</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">c</annotation></semantics></math></span>? (שבר או עשרוני)",
       "explainHtml": "<span class=\"math-inline\"><math dir=\"ltr\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msubsup><mo>∫</mo><mrow><mo>−</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><mn>1</mn></msubsup><mi>c</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>−</mo><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mtext> </mtext><mi>d</mi><mi>x</mi><mo>=</mo><mi>c</mi><msubsup><mrow><mo fence=\"true\">[</mo><mi>x</mi><mo>−</mo><mfrac><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>3</mn></msup><mn>3</mn></mfrac><mo fence=\"true\">]</mo></mrow><mrow><mo>−</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><mn>1</mn></msubsup><mo>=</mo><mi>c</mi><mrow><mo fence=\"true\">(</mo><mfrac><mn>2</mn><mn>3</mn></mfrac><mo>+</mo><mfrac><mn>2</mn><mn>3</mn></mfrac><mo fence=\"true\">)</mo></mrow><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mn>4</mn><mi>c</mi></mrow><mn>3</mn></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\int_{-1}^{1}c(1-x^2)\\,dx=c\\left[x-\\frac{x^3}{3}\\right]_{-1}^{1}=c\\left(\\frac23+\\frac23\\right)=\\frac{4c}{3}=1</annotation></semantics></math></span>, ולכן <span class=\"math-inline\"><math dir=\"ltr\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>c</mi><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mn>3</mn><mn>4</mn></mfrac></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">c=\\frac34</annotation></semantics></math></span>."
      },
