       "type": "numeric",
       "prompt": "הצפיפות היא $f(x)=a$ בקטע $[-2,0)$ ו-$f(x)=b\\,e^{-x}$ ל-$x\\ge0$ (ו-0 לפני $-2$), ונתון $E[X]=0$. מהו $b$? (שבר או עשרוני)",
       "answer": 0.5,
       "tol": 0.001,
       "explain": "נרמול: $2a+b\\int_0^\\infty e^{-x}dx=2a+b=1$. תוחלת: $\\int_{-2}^0 x\\,a\\,dx+b\\int_0^\\infty x\\,e^{-x}dx=-2a+b=0$. לכן $b=2a$ ו-$4a=1$: $a=\\frac14$, $b=\\frac12$.",
       "promptHtml": "הצפיפות היא <span class=\"math-inline\"><math dir=\"ltr\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>f</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>x</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>=</mo><mi>a</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">f(x)=a</annotation></semantics></math></span> בקטע <span class=\"math-inline\"><math dir=\"ltr\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo stretchy=\"false\">[</mo><mo>−</mo><mn>2</mn><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mn>0</mn><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">[-2,0)</annotation></semantics></math></span> ו-<span class=\"math-inline\"><math dir=\"ltr\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>f</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>x</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>=</mo><mi>b</mi><mtext> </mtext><msup><mi>e</mi><mrow><mo>−</mo><mi>x</mi></mrow></msup></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">f(x)=b\\,e^{-x}</annotation></semantics></math></span> ל-<span class=\"math-inline\"><math dir=\"ltr\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>x</mi><mo>≥</mo><mn>0</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">x\\ge0</annotation></semantics></math></span> (ו-0 לפני <span class=\"math-inline\"><math dir=\"ltr\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo>−</mo><mn>2</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">-2</annotation></semantics></math></span>), ונתון <span class=\"math-inline\"><math dir=\"ltr\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>E</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">[</mo><mi>X</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">]</mo><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">E[X]=0</annotation></semantics></math></span>. מהו <span class=\"math-inline\"><math dir=\"ltr\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>b</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">b</annotation></semantics></math></span>? (שבר או עשרוני)",
       "explainHtml": "נרמול: <span class=\"math-inline\"><math dir=\"ltr\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>2</mn><mi>a</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>b</mi><msubsup><mo>∫</mo><mn>0</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">∞</mi></msubsup><msup><mi>e</mi><mrow><mo>−</mo><mi>x</mi></mrow></msup><mi>d</mi><mi>x</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>2</mn><mi>a</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>b</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">2a+b\\int_0^\\infty e^{-x}dx=2a+b=1</annotation></semantics></math></span>. תוחלת: <span class=\"math-inline\"><math dir=\"ltr\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msubsup><mo>∫</mo><mrow><mo>−</mo><mn>2</mn></mrow><mn>0</mn></msubsup><mi>x</mi><mtext> </mtext><mi>a</mi><mtext> </mtext><mi>d</mi><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>b</mi><msubsup><mo>∫</mo><mn>0</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">∞</mi></msubsup><mi>x</mi><mtext> </mtext><msup><mi>e</mi><mrow><mo>−</mo><mi>x</mi></mrow></msup><mi>d</mi><mi>x</mi><mo>=</mo><mo>−</mo><mn>2</mn><mi>a</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>b</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\int_{-2}^0 x\\,a\\,dx+b\\int_0^\\infty x\\,e^{-x}dx=-2a+b=0</annotation></semantics></math></span>. לכן <span class=\"math-inline\"><math dir=\"ltr\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>b</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>2</mn><mi>a</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">b=2a</annotation></semantics></math></span> ו-<span class=\"math-inline\"><math dir=\"ltr\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>4</mn><mi>a</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">4a=1</annotation></semantics></math></span>: <span class=\"math-inline\"><math dir=\"ltr\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>a</mi><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mn>4</mn></mfrac></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">a=\\frac14</annotation></semantics></math></span>, <span class=\"math-inline\"><math dir=\"ltr\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>b</mi><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mn>2</mn></mfrac></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">b=\\frac12</annotation></semantics></math></span>."
