      "recap": "$P(a<X<b)=F(b)-F(a)$, כל קצה בענף שלו.",
      "recapHtml": "<span class=\"math-inline\"><math dir=\"ltr\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>P</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>a</mi><mo>&lt;</mo><mi>X</mi><mo>&lt;</mo><mi>b</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>=</mo><mi>F</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>b</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>−</mo><mi>F</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>a</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">P(a&lt;X&lt;b)=F(b)-F(a)</annotation></semantics></math></span>, כל קצה בענף שלו."
