       "tol": 0.0006,
       "explain": "$F(2)-F(1)=\\left(1-e^{-4}\\right)-\\left(1-e^{-2}\\right)=e^{-2}-e^{-4}\\approx0.1353-0.0183=0.1170$.",
       "promptHtml": "ההתפלגות המצטברת היא <span class=\"math-inline\"><math dir=\"ltr\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>F</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>t</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>−</mo><msup><mi>e</mi><mrow><mo>−</mo><mn>2</mn><mi>t</mi></mrow></msup></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">F(t)=1-e^{-2t}</annotation></semantics></math></span> ל-<span class=\"math-inline\"><math dir=\"ltr\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>t</mi><mo>≥</mo><mn>0</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">t\\ge0</annotation></semantics></math></span> (ו-0 ל-<span class=\"math-inline\"><math dir=\"ltr\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>t</mi><mo>&lt;</mo><mn>0</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">t&lt;0</annotation></semantics></math></span>). מהי <span class=\"math-inline\"><math dir=\"ltr\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>P</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>&lt;</mo><mi>X</mi><mo>&lt;</mo><mn>2</mn><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">P(1&lt;X&lt;2)</annotation></semantics></math></span>? (עשרוני, ארבע ספרות אחרי הנקודה)",
